**Implemented:** Line clearing with scoring

- `clear_lines()` — detects full rows, removes them, inserts empty rows at top, updates score using standard Tetris scoring (100/300/500/800 for 1/2/3/4 lines × cumulative lines bonus)
- Score display rendered at bottom of screen via `pygame.font.Font`
- Line clearing triggers automatically when a piece locks

**Next recommended increment:** Hard drop (`SPACE` key to instantly drop the piece) — a core Tetris control that players expect.
